---
interface Props {
  cycle: string;
  introText: string;
}

const { cycle, introText } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section-spacing intro-section" id="pengantar" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-header">
      <span class="badge">Pengantar Akademik</span>
      <h2 id="intro-title" class="intro-title">Tentang E-Portfolio PPL Mandiri</h2>
      <p class="intro-lead">
        {introText}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon-box">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">1. Bukti Utama Praktik</h3>
        <p class="pillar-text">
          Menampilkan rancangan pembelajaran utuh (Modul Ajar) dan video rekaman pelaksanaan praktik mengajar di kelas nyata sebagai bukti autentik aktivitas guru dan murid.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Fokus: {cycle}</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon-box">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path>
            <path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">2. Analisis Berbasis Teori</h3>
        <p class="pillar-text">
          Mengkaji setiap artefak pembelajaran (media, LKPD, rubrik asesmen, dan karya murid) secara mendalam dengan landasan teori pedagogis dan bukti terukur di lapangan.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Kajian Kritis</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon-box">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">3. Refleksi & Tindak Lanjut</h3>
        <p class="pillar-text">
          Merumuskan filosofi mengajar, mengevaluasi kekuatan dan keterbatasan diri, serta menyusun rencana aksi konkret demi peningkatan kompetensi profesional berkelanjutan.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Pengembangan Diri</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-section {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .intro-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: var(--reading-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .intro-title {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .intro-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  }

  .pillar-icon-box {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary-light);
    color: var(--color-primary-active);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .pillar-text {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .pillar-tag {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>

